| `expected_info_dk<K>()` | `expected_info_tensor<1, K>` | Parameter derivatives of \f$I(\mu)\f$ of order \f$K \in \{1, \dots, 4\}\f$. |
| `expected_info_d1()` ... `_d4()` | `expected_info_tensor<1, K>` | Parameter derivatives of \f$I(\mu)\f$ for orders 1 to 4. |
